	dcterms:description "Catalytic co-methanation of a mixed CO/CO2 feed (CO + 3H2 -> CH4 + H2O; CO2 + 4H2 -> CH4 + 2H2O) screened over 4 supported Ni catalysts (ZrO2, SiO2, TiO2, Al2O3 supports; 5 wt% Ni in all 4) in cylindrical isothermal fixed-bed reactors (radius 3.77-6.5 mm across runs). Steady-state CO and CO2 conversion measured as a function of superficial velocity and temperature. Source runs: Exp11, Exp18, Exp19, Exp20. Total pressure ~100 kPa in all four runs." ;
